      "source_unit_id": "ibn_hajar_isabah_v1:arabic:v08:p0401:3546ec9bcc5e2706",
      "arabic": "رشدين بن سعد، عن أبي بكر الأنصاريّ، عن سيرة عن أمّه- أنها سمعت رسول اللَّه ﵌ يقول: «لا صلاة لمن لا وضوء له، ولا وضوء لمن لم يذكر اللَّه ...»\nالحديث.\nوقال: في إسناد حديثها نظر.",
      "english": "Rishdin ibn Sa'd, from Abu Bakr al-Ansari, from Sira, from his mother, who heard the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, say: “There is no prayer for one who has no ablution, and no ablution for one who did not mention Allah…”—the hadith.\n\nHe said: There is some question concerning the chain of transmission of her hadith.",
      "arabic_sha256": "d0ac540366d4225c8f63e98961b8ede98acf827b3b0593ff1496a66d7e7dcff3",
